---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '~/components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Dan Betts — The Breaking Dad"
  description="Dan Betts is a UK dad based in Hampshire. Eight years into co-parenting his daughter Evie, six years into blended family life. He writes about separated parenting, family life, and the products he actually uses."
>
  <article class="about-page">
    <div class="about-page__crumb-row">
      <div class="container">
        <Breadcrumbs trail={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'About', href: '/about/' }]} />
      </div>
    </div>

    <header class="about-page__head">
      <div class="container--narrow">
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow-accent">The byline</span>
        <h1 class="display-2 about-page__title">A dad behind the keyboard.</h1>
        <p class="lede about-page__lede">
          I'm Dan. UK father, Hampshire-based. Eight years co-parenting my eldest, six into blended family life
          with my partner Rosie and our girls. The Breaking Dad is the writing I needed when I was figuring it
          all out, and didn't find anywhere else.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="container">
        <div class="about-page__hero" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="about-page__hero-illus illus illus--kids"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="about-page__body">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="about-page__grid">
          <div class="about-page__main">
            <div class="prose">
              <h2>The short version</h2>
              <p>
                Three daughters, two stepdaughters. Separated from my eldest's mum in 2016 when she was two.
                Since then I've been co-parenting her on a shared arrangement — eight years and counting —
                while also navigating the complexities of blended family life with my partner Rosie, her two
                daughters, and our youngest, Millie.
              </p>
              <p>
                I started The Breaking Dad because I couldn't find the writing I needed when I needed it most.
                Everything I found about separated parenting was either clinical, legal, or soaked in judgment.
                None of it sounded like a real person. None of it acknowledged how hard the early days actually
                are, or how messy the emotions get even when you're trying your best.
              </p>

              <h2>Why I write what I write</h2>
              <p>
                The Separated parents section is built from experience. I've navigated the CMS. I've been
                through mediation. I've introduced Rosie to my eldest, not overnight and not without anxiety.
                I've had to learn about child arrangements, benefits, and the financial side of separation the
                hard way. I write about what I've actually lived, and I signpost to proper resources when
                something is genuinely outside my lane.
              </p>
              <p>
                The Reviews are honest in the old-fashioned sense. I use things for months or years, then
                I write about whether they were worth it. Some I buy, some are sent for review, and either
                way the verdict's mine. There are affiliate links on some, but they don't change what I say.
                <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Full disclosure here</a>.
              </p>
              <p>
                The Diary is where I write without a brief. No SEO targets, no keyword strategy. Just personal
                pieces about what it actually feels like to be a dad in the middle of all this.
              </p>

              <h2>The family</h2>
              <p>
                Rosie and I have been together since 2018 and moved in together in 2020. Brave or slightly mad,
                depending on the day — we did it in a pandemic with three girls under ten. Millie arrived in
                2021. So we went from zero to a household of six fairly quickly.
              </p>
              <p>
                We live in Hampshire. I work from home, drink a lot of strong tea, run in Vivobarefoot shoes.
                I'm occasionally found building cardboard structures with small children on weekend afternoons.
              </p>

              <h2>Work with me</h2>
              <p>
                If you're a brand that wants to work with me, please read the
                <a href="/work-with-us/">Work with us</a> page first. I only work with brands whose products
                I'd genuinely consider using myself, and I don't take payments to change my editorial position.
              </p>

              <h2>Get in touch</h2>
              <p>
                The best way to reach me is via the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. I read everything,
                though I can't always reply as quickly as I'd like.
              </p>
              <p>
                Or find me on Instagram:
                <a href="https://www.instagram.com/thebreakingdad" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@thebreakingdad</a>.
                I'm most active there and usually respond to DMs faster than email.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <aside class="about-page__byline">
            <div class="about-page__byline-card">
              <img
                src="/images/dan-betts-avatar.jpg"
                alt="Dan Betts"
                class="about-page__byline-avatar"
                width="56"
                height="56"
                loading="lazy"
              />
              <div class="about-page__byline-name">Dan Betts</div>
              <div class="about-page__byline-loc">Hampshire, UK</div>
              <ul class="about-page__byline-stats">
                <li><strong>2016</strong><span>Separated</span></li>
                <li><strong>2020</strong><span>Blended household</span></li>
                <li><strong>5</strong><span>Daughters &amp; stepdaughters</span></li>
              </ul>
              <a href="/contact/" class="btn ghost about-page__byline-cta">Get in touch</a>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page { background: var(--color-paper); }

  .about-page__crumb-row {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-rule-soft);
    padding-block: 14px;
  }

  .about-page__head {
    padding-block: 44px 0;
  }

  .about-page__title {
    margin: 12px 0 18px;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .about-page__lede {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .about-page__hero {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 16/7;
  }

  .about-page__hero-illus {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .about-page__body {
    padding-block: 48px 64px;
  }

  .about-page__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1100px) {
    .about-page__grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 280px;
      gap: 56px;
      align-items: start;
    }
  }

  .about-page__main {
    max-width: 680px;
    width: 100%;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .about-page__main .prose { max-width: 680px; }

  /* Byline card (right column) */
  .about-page__byline {
    position: sticky;
    top: 90px;
    align-self: start;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1099px) {
    .about-page__byline { display: none; }
  }

  .about-page__byline-card {
    background: var(--color-paper-tinted-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent-soft);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 24px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-page__byline-avatar {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    margin: 0 auto 14px;
  }

  .about-page__byline-name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;
    letter-spacing: -0.012em;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .about-page__byline-loc {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-ink-3);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .about-page__byline-stats {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    padding: 18px 0 4px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-accent-soft);
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .about-page__byline-stats li {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .about-page__byline-stats strong {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 22px;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    letter-spacing: -0.012em;
  }

  .about-page__byline-stats span {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-ink-3);
  }

  .about-page__byline-cta {
    width: 100%;
    justify-content: center;
  }
</style>
